  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Viewing a reference genome in a browser alongside annotation, read-alignment (BAM/CRAM), variant (VCF) and signal tracks, moving to genes or coordinates, checking reads and genotypes, and saving or sharing the view as a session. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
